Package: bibnets
Title: Importing, Constructing, and Exporting Bibliometric Networks
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mohammed", "Saqr", , "saqr@saqr.me", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5881-3109")),
    person("Sonsoles", "López-Pernas", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9621-1392")))
Description: Imports, constructs, and exports bibliometric networks. Reads
    scholarly metadata from 'Scopus', 'Web of Science', 'BibTeX',
    'RIS', 'OpenAlex', 'Lens.org', 'Dimensions', and 'Crossref'
    exports. Builds co-authorship, keyword co-occurrence, co-citation,
    bibliographic coupling, and direct citation networks with multiple
    counting and normalisation methods. Includes tools for temporal
    analysis, backbone extraction, and export to 'igraph',
    'tidygraph', 'cograph', 'Gephi', 'GraphML', and sparse matrix
    formats.
